<title>LITHUANIA: KALNAPILIS TO PAY 2.2 MLN LITAS DIVIDENDS.</title>
<headline>KALNAPILIS TO PAY 2.2 MLN LITAS DIVIDENDS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's Kalnapilis brewery said on Thursday that it will pay 2.2 million litas in dividends.</p>
<p>&quot;The shareholders' meeting decided on Wednesday to pay 0.25 litas per share with one litas face value and the sum paid in dividends will be 2.2 million litas,&quot; the company's general director Lionginas Mackevichius told Reuters.</p>
<p>The company reported earlier that its net profit was 10.43 million litas versus 4.2 million litas the previous year.</p>
<p>--Vilnius newroom + 370 2 22 35 17</p>
